communications.activationBody:
Hello {seller},

You are registered as a seller at {store}. Confirm your email address using the button below. If your account is new, you can then choose a password.

{activation}

If you already have an account, your password stays the same. Sign in:
{url}

trial_tomorrow.text:
Hello,

The free trial for {store} ends on {date}. Activate the subscription under Settings to keep recording items, sales and payouts:
{link}

trial_ended.text:
Hello,

The trial for {store} ended on {date}. The store continues for free with every feature. The AI assistant runs on the month's included credits; more credits and an own model key are under Settings:
{link}

grace_week.text:
Hello,

The last payment for {store} failed. If it is not settled by {date} the store continues without a subscription; every feature stays open. Update the payment method under Settings:
{link}
